###1. Go to kali.org -> Select the Virtual Machine pre-build image -> Load on Oracle Virtual Box 
### 1. Virtual Machine Setup on Kali.
- Open **VirtualBox → Settings → Network**  
- Set the adapter to **Bridge**  
- After the installationg, open the Terminal as Root and Download FreeRDP3:
sudo apt update
sudo apt install freerdp3-x11   
